### PHASE 27: ADMIN SUPPORT INBOX & PROJECT CLOSURE REQUESTS

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@userToken = Bearer <USER_JWT>
@adminSupportToken = Bearer <ADMIN_WITH_SUPPORT_PERMISSION_JWT>
@superuserToken = Bearer <SUPERUSER_JWT>

### 1. Visitor Help Ticket Submission (email required when unauthenticated)
POST {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "help",
  "email": "visitor@example.com",
  "subject": "Trouble verifying email link",
  "message": "The verification link says expired even though I requested it a minute ago."
}

### 2. Authenticated User Creates Help Ticket (5/day cap, ContentFilter enforced)
POST {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "help",
  "priority": "normal",
  "subject": "Cannot export finished project markdown",
  "message": "Clicked the Export Markdown button twice in Closed project workspace with no download."
}

### 3. User Lists Own Tickets & Views Single Ticket (internal notes stripped)
GET {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets
Authorization: {{userToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets/<TICKET_ID>
Authorization: {{userToken}}

### 4. User Replies While Ticket Open / In Progress / Waiting User
POST {{baseUrl}}/support/tickets/<TICKET_ID>/replies
Authorization: {{userToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Attached project ID #proj-1; issue still persists on Chrome."
}

### 5. Admin Support Inbox List (Paged, Filtered, Newest First - requires "support" permission)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/support/tickets?status=open&type=all&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: {{adminSupportToken}}

### 6. Admin Assigns, Changes Priority, & Transitions Status
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/support/tickets/<TICKET_ID>
Authorization: {{adminSupportToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assigneeId": "u-superuser",
  "priority": "high",
  "status": "in_progress"
}

### 7. Admin Posts Internal Note vs Public Reply
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/support/tickets/<TICKET_ID>/replies
Authorization: {{adminSupportToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Internal investigation: verified user project status is still Active.",
  "internal": true
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/support/tickets/<TICKET_ID>/replies
Authorization: {{adminSupportToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "body": "Hi! Markdown export requires the project to be Closed or Completed first.",
  "internal": false
}

### 8. Admin Resolves Ticket With Mandatory Visible Note (10-500 chars)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/admin/support/tickets/<TICKET_ID>
Authorization: {{adminSupportToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "resolved",
  "note": "Explained export lifecycle prerequisites and verified user resolved issue."
}

### 9. Admin Closes Abandoned Project From Project Closure Ticket (Owner inactive + Phase 9 Escrow Refund)
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/support/tickets/<CLOSURE_TICKET_ID>/close-project
Authorization: {{superuserToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Confirmed project owner has been inactive for 35 days; closing project and refunding held escrow."
}
